💭 A generic class that uses itself with a larger generic argument (polymorphic recursion) must not make the
💭 compiler recurse forever while resolving the type of the erased method that constructs it (issue #115). The class
💭 is public, so 🌰 is called through the erased implementation instead of a specialization; its result must carry
💭 the runtime generic argument the caller actually wrote, 🍨🐚🔡🍆, not a further expanded 🍨🐚🍨🐚🔡🍆🍆.
